    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ECO201 · Assessment 2/6</span>\n<h2>Group Presentation</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14481 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ECO201 · Đầu điểm 2/6</span>\n<h2>Group Presentation</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14481 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">20.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">90'</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">LO2, LO3, LO4, LO5, LO6, LO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: about the chosen topic infront of the class in 45 minutes. The teacher will summarise the key points. The presentation/discussion in class is expected to answer student's questions/wonders about what they are not sure, not very things mentioned in the materials.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: Based on the first twelve chapters of this course (cover both classical and modern theories of international trade as well as examine the efficient of trade policies)<br>Option 2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: The mark will be given based on each student's performance, not on the whole group's. It means each student will get their own mark.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 55 — Group presentation</li><li>Session 56 — Group presentation</li><li>Session 57 — Group presentation</li><li>Session 58 — Group presentation</li><li>Session 59 — Group presentation</li><li>Session 60 — Group presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 55 — Group presentation</li><li>Buổi 56 — Group presentation</li><li>Buổi 57 — Group presentation</li><li>Buổi 58 — Group presentation</li><li>Buổi 59 — Group presentation</li><li>Buổi 60 — Group presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practice papers: <a href=\"/exam?course=ECO201\">Exam Room — ECO201</a> (4 papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Đề luyện: <a href=\"/exam?course=ECO201\">Phòng thi — ECO201</a> (4 đề: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
